<title>USA: Bell &amp; Howell signs distribution agreement.</title>
<headline>Bell &amp; Howell signs distribution agreement.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell &amp; Howell Co's scanner division said Tuesday it signed a U.S. distribution agreement with Tech Data Corp and sold its Canadian distribution operation to a Tech Data unit, Tech Data Canada.</p>
<p>Terms of the deals were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Bell &amp; Howell said the agreements give it broader distribution of its document scanner line.</p>
<p>The company said its core strengths are in manufacturing, not distribution, and therefore needed a distribution alliance offering extensive sales and service networks throughout the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
